{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W45", "prepared_on": "2026-11-07", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-11-02 ～ 2026-11-07</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI valued at $1.25 trillion, as rival Anthropic nears its IPO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 估值達 1.25 兆美元，對手 Anthropic 也逼近 IPO</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI reportedly raised another $11 billion at a $1.25 trillion valuation, up from $852 billion in March. The round has not closed yet.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據報導，OpenAI 再募得 110 億美元，估值達 1.25 兆美元，3 月時為 8,520 億美元。這輪募資尚未完成。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1029380/openai-1-25-trillion-investment-valuation\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI releases GPT-6 Cyber, finds 81 unknown high-risk Firefox vulnerabilities<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI發表GPT-6 Cyber，找出Firefox 81個未知高風險漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI's security-focused model found 81 previously unknown high-risk bugs in Firefox. It also built working exploits for 948 Linux kernel vulnerabilities.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這個專為資安研究開發的模型，在 Firefox 找到 81 個先前未知的高風險漏洞，並為 948 個 Linux 核心漏洞開發出可實際運作的攻擊程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180285\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Free Chinese AI Models Are Getting Scary Good at Hacking<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">免費的中國 AI 模型，駭客能力強得嚇人</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">In an experiment where AI models tried to break into simulated networks, DeepSeek and GLM came close to OpenAI's most advanced cyber model, which isn't public.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">實驗讓 AI 模型嘗試入侵模擬網路，DeepSeek 與 GLM 的表現，和未公開的 OpenAI 最先進資安模型相差不遠。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/free-chinese-ai-models-are-getting-scary-good-at-hacking/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> How a Blue Wave midterm might reshape the AI industry<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">民主黨期中選舉大勝，可能如何改變 AI 產業</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Voters decided 41 data center ballot measures on Tuesday. All but one passed with majority support for tighter restrictions on data center development.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">選民週二就 41 項資料中心相關公投案投票，除一項外，多數選民都支持對資料中心開發加上更多限制。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/podcast/how-a-blue-wave-midterm-might-reshape-the-ai-industry/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Chainalysis says hackers stole credentials and tokens for all of its customers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Chainalysis 表示駭客竊走所有客戶的憑證與權杖</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The company described a \"multifront cyberattack\" that involved AI agents and an on-path data snatch.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">公司指出這是一場「多面向網路攻擊」，涉及 AI 代理與路徑上的資料攔截。據 iThome 報導，該公司已暫停 KYT 等多項服務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/11/chainalysis-says-hackers-stole-credentials-and-tokens-for-all-of-its-customers/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> China reportedly recruited AI exec to spy on Jensen Huang<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">據報中國招募 AI 主管，監視黃仁勳</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The New York Times reports that China's Ministry of State Security recruited Megaspeed executive Alice Huang to gather information on Nvidia's CEO and American AI chips.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">《紐約時報》報導，中國國家安全部招募 Megaspeed 主管 Alice Huang，蒐集 Nvidia 執行長與美國 AI 晶片的資訊。美國國會隨後傳喚黃仁勳。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1029338/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-china-spy\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Claude can now analyze your spending with its new Personal Finance tool<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude 推出個人理財工具，可分析你的支出</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Users can connect bank and card accounts through Plaid and ask Claude questions about their finances.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">使用者可透過 Plaid 連結銀行與信用卡帳戶，向 Claude 詢問自己的財務狀況。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/claude-can-now-analyze-your-spending-with-its-new-personal-finance-tool/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Google to invest $17B in first Wyoming data center powered by fuel cells<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google擴大AI基礎設施投資，首度進駐懷俄明州建資料中心</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google will spend $17 billion on a Wyoming data center with 702MW of gas fuel cells and carbon capture. It pledges to cover its own power and infrastructure costs.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 將投資 170 億美元興建懷俄明州首座資料中心，採用 702MW 天然氣燃料電池搭配碳捕捉，並承諾自行負擔用電與基礎設施成本。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180286\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Meta's Muse AI can create custom 'spaces' for the version of the app you need right now<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 的 Muse AI 可建立客製化「空間」，隨時變出你當下需要的 App</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new \"spaces\" feature lets Muse build app-like experiences such as a shopping hub, school dashboard, music tracker or trivia game.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新功能「spaces」讓 Muse 在 App 內建立類似應用程式的體驗，例如購物中心、學校儀表板、音樂追蹤器或問答遊戲。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1028871/meta-muse-ai-spaces\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Ramp data shows AI spending stalling just as Anthropic nears its IPO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Ramp 數據顯示 AI 支出停滯，恰逢 Anthropic 逼近 IPO</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI usage keeps climbing but spending has stalled. Price cuts and tighter cost controls among the biggest spenders could challenge investors' hypergrowth assumptions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 使用量持續攀升，支出卻停滯。降價以及大戶更嚴格的成本控管，可能動搖投資人對 AI 超高成長的假設。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/ramp-data-shows-ai-spending-stalling-just-as-anthropic-nears-its-ipo/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}